flowchart TD
    SELECT[Select TrialIQ study of interest] --> QUESTION[Enter question]
    QUESTION --> MODE{Direct or Guided}
    MODE -->|Direct| RUN[Run TrialIQ query]
    MODE -->|Guided| DISCOVERY[Agent discovery]
    DISCOVERY --> BROAD{More than 6 candidates?}
    BROAD -->|Yes| HITL[Choose studies to investigate\nUse suggested / Analyse selected / Analyse all]
    BROAD -->|No| RUN
    HITL --> RUN

    RUN --> ANSWER[Answer tab\nGrounded conclusion]
    ANSWER --> STUDIES[Studies tab\nfilters + timeline + comparison]
    ANSWER --> CONNECTIONS[Connections tab\nCondition / Intervention / Sponsor explanation]
    ANSWER --> EVIDENCE[Evidence tab\nsource + validation]
    STUDIES --> CONNECTIONS
    CONNECTIONS --> TECH[Optional technical graph explorer\nNetwork / Table]
    CONNECTIONS --> EVIDENCE
    EVIDENCE --> REPORT[Prepare report]
    REPORT --> PDF[Download deterministic PDF]
